### jaehoon으로 로그인
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v2/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "jaehoon",
  "password": "jaehoon1234"
}

### minji 팔로우
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v2/profiles/minji/followers/me

### 한 번 더 팔로우
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v2/profiles/minji/followers/me

### 팔로우 취소
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v2/profiles/minji/followers/me

### 한 번 더 취소
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v2/profiles/minji/followers/me

### 나 자신을 팔로우
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v2/profiles/jaehoon/followers/me

### 없는 사람을 팔로우
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v2/profiles/nobody/followers/me

### minji의 프로필 - 팔로워 수 · 팔로잉 수 · 내가 팔로우하고 있는지
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v2/profiles/minji

### 내 프로필
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v2/profiles/jaehoon

### minji의 팔로워
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v2/profiles/minji/followers
